1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,440
My reflection just blinked three full seconds before I did, shattering every law of nature in my quiet bathroom.

2
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:14,220
I froze, watching her raise a trembling hand to press flat against the cold glass surface ahead of me.

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:23,568
My own hand lifted a second later to match hers, but her fingers were already tracing desperate words backward.

4
00:00:23,868 --> 00:00:29,916
The letters spelled out a warning I refused to read: 'Step back, she is coming behind you.'

5
00:00:30,216 --> 00:00:36,816
A sudden shadow fell across the bathroom doorway, blocking the harsh hallway light and freezing my breath.

6
00:00:37,116 --> 00:00:44,628
I spun around to face the intruder, but the hallway was completely empty, silent, and bitterly cold.

7
00:00:44,928 --> 00:00:52,056
When I looked back at the mirror, my reflection was smiling with a terrifying, absolute sense of relief.

8
00:00:52,356 --> 00:00:59,532
She slammed her fist through the glass, and jagged shards exploded outward into my empty hallway.

9
00:00:59,832 --> 00:01:06,216
Suddenly, I was the one standing inside the cold frame, watching her bleed on the real floor.

10
00:01:06,516 --> 00:01:12,852
She touched the glass from the outside, crying as she realized too late who was trapped inside.
